{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"INSANE","artist":"Black Gryph0n & Baasik","date":"2026-08-01","sourceId":"14489268:016","sourceHash":"6d4b90d7b0d16c9b29ed623b37fd72f297d3d502c3188d5f247e62d09e057f08","duration":161.8,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.66,"end":9.91,"text":"Dearly beloved! For your entertainment","translation":"사랑하는 여러분 여러분의 즐거움을 위해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":9.91,"end":11.19,"text":"It's my pleasure to introduce to you","translation":"지옥에 새로 도착한 이를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":11.19,"end":12.73,"text":"hell's latest arrival","translation":"소개하게 되어 기쁩니다","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":12.73,"end":15.56,"text":"The equal-opportunity killer, Alastor!","translation":"누구에게나 공평한 살인자 알래스터","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":15.92,"end":18.32,"text":"Hello, it's nice to meet you","translation":"안녕 만나서 반가워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":18.32,"end":20.2,"text":"Oh, can you tell me where I am?","translation":"내가 어디 있는지 알려 줄래","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":20.2,"end":22.28,"text":"I don't know how I got here","translation":"어떻게 여기 왔는지는 모르지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":22.28,"end":24.48,"text":"But I, I think I'm starting to understand","translation":"이제 조금씩 알 것 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":24.48,"end":27.52,"text":"I don't belong among the angels","translation":"난 천사들 사이에 어울리지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":27.6,"end":29.52,"text":"And baby, that's just fine with me","translation":"그리고 그게 난 아주 좋아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":29.52,"end":31.76,"text":"The things I did up there were high school","translation":"위에서 했던 일은 고등학교 수준","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":31.76,"end":34.72,"text":"But now I'm going for my degree Hey","translation":"이제는 학위에 도전할 거야 이봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":34.72,"end":36.9,"text":"Sorry, but you just got in my way","translation":"미안하지만 네가 내 길을 막았어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":36.9,"end":39.16,"text":"I promise honey, I can feel your pain","translation":"약속할게 자기야 네 고통이 느껴져","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":39.16,"end":41.88,"text":"And maybe I enjoy it just a little bit","translation":"그리고 어쩌면 난 그걸 조금 즐기는지도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":41.88,"end":43.9,"text":"Does that make me insane?","translation":"그럼 내가 미친 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":43.9,"end":46.48,"text":"Haven't been the same since I expired","translation":"죽은 뒤로 예전 같지는 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":46.48,"end":48.16,"text":"Doesn't mean that I plan to retire","translation":"그렇다고 은퇴할 생각은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":48.16,"end":49.54,"text":"And now I have the power","translation":"이제는 너희 모두를","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":49.54,"end":53.14,"text":"to bathe all of you in entertaining fire","translation":"즐거운 불길에 담글 힘이 있지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":70.88,"end":73.16,"text":"Wait a minute, do I know you?","translation":"잠깐만 내가 널 아나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":73.16,"end":75.38,"text":"Weren't you an old pal of mine?","translation":"예전 내 친구 아니었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":75.44,"end":77.34,"text":"Departed from us far too early","translation":"너무 일찍 우리 곁을 떠났지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":77.34,"end":79.84,"text":"But now we're meeting a second time","translation":"이제 두 번째로 만나는군","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":79.84,"end":81.76,"text":"We used to have such fun together","translation":"우리 함께 정말 즐거웠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":81.76,"end":84.16,"text":"And maybe you have what I need","translation":"어쩌면 넌 내게 필요한 걸 가졌을지도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":84.16,"end":86.58,"text":"But first I have one tiny question","translation":"하지만 먼저 작은 질문 하나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":86.58,"end":89.98,"text":"Tell me, do you demons bleed?","translation":"말해 봐 악마도 피를 흘리나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":90.82,"end":91.66,"text":"Hey","translation":"이봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":91.66,"end":94.0,"text":"Sorry, but you just got in my way","translation":"미안하지만 네가 내 길을 막았어","kind"